   "text": "Western Washington University (Undergraduate) - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nWestern Washington University (Undergraduate)\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nViewer Access\nAny user can see this institution.\nDescription\nWestern Washington University provides international students with the opportunity to study on a beautiful campus located in Bellingham, Washington. Located just 50 miles from Vancouver and 90 miles from Seattle, the campus provides an ideal location and offers over 175 academic programs. At the International Study Center, international students complete year 1 of university in a supportive environment with expert staff who will help prepare students for success as a student at Western Washington University.\nTimestamps\nUpdated\n15/05/2026 05:50\nby Gunia Beniwal\nCreated\n11/01/2021 07:07\nby Data Migration\nType\nUniversity\nCountry\nUnited States\nYearly Fees\nMax: US$50,000.00\nMin: US$25,000.00\nInternational Students\nPercentage of International Students\n1%\n160 of 16,000 Total Students\nOverview\nBasic Details\nInstitution Details\nOwnership\nPublic\nProvider\nStudy Group\nFounded Year\n1893\nCampus(es)\nBellingham, Washington\nCountry\nUnited States\nExcluded Countries\nNA\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\n No\nContract Start Date\n01/04/2026\nContract End Date\n31/12/2026\nContract Entity\nQSSA Ltd\nContract Status\nActive\nContract Document Link(s)\nN/A\nImages\nImages\nAdditional Details\nAccommodation Details\nAccommodation available\nScholarship Offered\n-\nYouTube Video Link(s)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_nd_TP6rHQs\nInternship Details\n-\nAdditional Information\n-",
